%% 事实源: .doc/walle-architecture-topology.json view_agent_turn
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User or Client
  participant R as Runtime
  participant C as Context Manager
  participant A as Agent ReAct loop
  participant M as LLM Adapter
  participant T as Tools Registry
  participant E as Tool Event Sink
  participant S as Session Store

  U->>R: input text
  R->>A: RunStream(messageCtx, input)
  A->>C: add user message
  A->>C: get messages
  A->>M: stream with bound tools
  M-->>A: assistant delta / tool calls
  A->>T: execute tool calls
  T-->>A: tool result / error
  A->>E: emit tool event
  A->>C: append assistant + tool messages
  C->>S: append / replace messages
  A-->>R: final answer or error
  R-->>U: stream tokens / done
